{"seq":3,"slug":"fee-change-impact","title":"费率变更对商家/GMV 影响评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-fee-commission-strategy/fee-strategy/fee-change-impact","wordCount":2624,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"费率变更对商家-gmv-影响评估\">费率变更对商家/GMV 影响评估</h1><p>一个平台把某品类的佣金从 12% 提到 14%，两周后该品类 GMV 下降了 6%。这个 6% 是费率造成的吗？可能不是——同期平台上有一个大型促销活动结束、一个竞品在做补贴、这个品类刚好进入季节性淡季。<strong>费率变更的影响评估之所以困难，根本原因是平台几乎不可能做随机实验</strong>：你不能把一半商家随机分配到 14% 费率、另一半留在 12%，因为这既不公平也可能违反合同与监管要求。本文讲的是在没有随机化的前提下，如何构造可信的对照、如何定义被解释变量、以及如何避免最常见的归因陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么不能只看变更前后曲线\">核心概念：为什么不能只看变更前后曲线</h2><p>最朴素的评估方式是&quot;变更前后对比&quot;（pre-post）：取变更前 30 天与变更后 30 天的 GMV 均值作差。它几乎总是错的，因为它把三部分变化混在了一起：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>fee</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>费率效应</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>season</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>季节/趋势</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>shock</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>同期其他事件</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta GMV = \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{fee}}}_{\\text{费率效应}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{season}}}_{\\text{季节/趋势}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{shock}}}_{\\text{同期其他事件}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">费率效应</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3813em;vertical-align:-1.698em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.477em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">季节</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">趋势</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">season</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.698em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">同期其他事件</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>费率变更从来不是孤立发生的，它往往与运营节奏绑定（新费率配合新市场招商、配合大促调整），因此同期事件的影响可能远大于费率本身。一个真实案例形态：平台在双十一前提高某品类费率以回收促销成本，变更后 GMV 大幅上升，于是得出结论&quot;提费率促进增长&quot;——实际是季节因素主导。</p>\n<p>**差分中的差分（difference-in-differences, DiD）**是最基础的修正手段。它要求存在一个未受费率变更影响、但受同样季节与冲击影响的对照组：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,pre</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,pre</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau} = (\\bar{Y}_{\\text{treat,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{treat,pre}}) - (\\bar{Y}_{\\text{control,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{control,pre}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>DiD 的关键假设是<strong>平行趋势（parallel trends）</strong>：如果没有费率变更，处理组与对照组的 GMV 变化趋势应当相同。这个假设不能被检验（因为它涉及反事实），但可以用变更前的历史数据做<strong>预趋势检验</strong>——如果变更前两组趋势就已经在发散，平行趋势假设大概率不成立，DiD 的结论不可信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构造对照组的四种方式\">构造对照组的四种方式</h2><p>没有随机实验时，对照组要靠设计。</p>\n<p><strong>地理/市场对照</strong>：费率变更只针对某个市场时，用其他市场作为对照。这是最干净的对照，因为市场间的隔离通常较彻底（商家不能轻易跨市场迁移）。前提是变更确实只在处理市场发生，且市场间没有共享的商家或商品池。</p>\n<p><strong>品类对照</strong>：变更针对某个品类时，用结构相似但未变更的品类作对照。麻烦在于品类之间的需求有替代关系——提高服饰费率可能把需求推向鞋类，此时对照组会被处理组的溢出污染，DiD 会<strong>低估</strong>费率效应（因为对照组的 GMV 被推高了）。缓解方式是选择替代性弱的品类作对照，或者显式建模替代效应。</p>\n<p><strong>商家分层对照</strong>：变更只影响高于某 GMV 门槛的商家时，门槛下方且接近门槛的商家是天然对照（断点回归，RD）。RD 的优势是识别非常接近因果——门槛两侧的商家在可观测与不可观测特征上都近似相同。要求是门槛两侧有足够多的商家，且商家不能精确操纵门槛（前文<a href=\"../fee-structure/tiered-commission\">分层佣金</a>已经讨论过操纵累计基数的动机，因此 RD 前必须检验门槛附近是否存在堆积）。</p>\n<p><strong>合成对照（synthetic control）</strong>：当处理单元只有一个（一个市场、一个平台），无法找到单一合适对照时，用多个未处理单元加权组合出一个&quot;合成的处理单元&quot;，使其在处理前的轨迹与真实处理单元尽可能吻合。这个方法适合平台级或市场级的重大费率变更评估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对照方式</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>主要威胁</th>\n<th>识别强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理/市场对照</td>\n<td>变更限定于部分市场</td>\n<td>市场间溢出</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类对照</td>\n<td>变更限定于部分品类</td>\n<td>品类替代</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家断点对照</td>\n<td>变更有明确门槛</td>\n<td>门槛操纵、样本量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成对照</td>\n<td>单一全局变更</td>\n<td>权重外推</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯前后对比</td>\n<td>无可用对照</td>\n<td>季节与冲击</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[费率变更定义] --&gt; B{变更范围}&#10;    B --&gt;|限定市场| C[地理对照 + DiD]&#10;    B --&gt;|限定品类| D[品类对照 + 替代效应检验]&#10;    B --&gt;|有明确门槛| E[断点回归]&#10;    B --&gt;|全局| F[合成对照]&#10;    C --&gt; G[预趋势检验]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; H[门槛堆积检验]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; I{假设是否成立}&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt;|成立| J[估计效应与置信区间]&#10;    I --&gt;|不成立| K[改换识别策略或声明不可识别]&#10;    J --&gt; L[商家流失与 GMV 分解]\">graph TD\n    A[费率变更定义] --&gt; B{变更范围}\n    B --&gt;|限定市场| C[地理对照 + DiD]\n    B --&gt;|限定品类| D[品类对照 + 替代效应检验]\n    B --&gt;|有明确门槛| E[断点回归]\n    B --&gt;|全局| F[合成对照]\n    C --&gt; G[预趋势检验]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; H[门槛堆积检验]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; I{假设是否成立}\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt;|成立| J[估计效应与置信区间]\n    I --&gt;|不成立| K[改换识别策略或声明不可识别]\n    J --&gt; L[商家流失与 GMV 分解]</pre><h2 id=\"被解释变量-gmv-不是最重要的那个\">被解释变量：GMV 不是最重要的那个</h2><p>多数费率评估把 GMV 当作主指标，这是选择偏差的结果——GMV 最容易取到。但对平台长期价值而言，<strong>商家流失率</strong>往往比 GMV 更重要。</p>\n<p>原因是 GMV 的两类下降含义完全不同。第一类是<strong>存量商家减少销售</strong>，它可能随费率回调而恢复；第二类是<strong>商家退出平台</strong>，它是不可逆的——商家迁移到了竞品、 rebuild 了运营体系，即使费率回调也很难回来。一个 GMV 下降 8% 的结果，如果全部来自第一类，是可控的；如果来自第二类，则是结构性的损失。</p>\n<p>因此评估至少要同时报告三个被解释变量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GMV</strong>：短期反应，有噪声但响应快。</li>\n<li><strong>活跃商家数</strong>与<strong>商家存续率</strong>：中等周期的供给反应。定义&quot;活跃&quot;必须谨慎——用&quot;当月至少一笔成交&quot;会把偶发成交的商家算进来，用&quot;连续三个月有成交&quot;更稳健但滞后。推荐同时给出两个版本。</li>\n<li><strong>商家侧经营指标</strong>：目标品类商家的毛利率变化、重新定价的行为（有多少商家在费率变更后调整了商品售价）。<strong>重新定价率是一个被严重低估的指标</strong>：如果大部分商家在提费后立刻提高了售价，说明商家把成本转嫁给了买家，那么费率上升的最终承担者是买家，平台的 GMV 损失来自需求侧的价格弹性，而不是商家利润被压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>还有一个必须做的分解：<strong>把 GMV 变化按&quot;商家数量 × 单商家 GMV&quot;分解</strong>，再进一步按&quot;新商家 / 老商家&quot;、&quot;大商家 / 小商家&quot;分组。同一总量的变化在分组上差异巨大时，整体数字会误导结论——例如整体 GMV 只降 2%，但小商家降 15%、大商家升 5%，此时&quot;整体轻微下降&quot;掩盖了小商家的加速退出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个常见的归因陷阱\">三个常见的归因陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：把弹性当成常数。</strong> 费率效应的量级取决于商家与买家的价格弹性，而弹性随幅度非线性变化。小幅提费（例如 1 个百分点）可能完全不改变行为（商家在利润里吸收），而大幅提费会突然触发商家迁移。因此<strong>不能把一次 1pp 变更测出的弹性外推到 5pp 的变更上</strong>。需要外推时，应当在多个历史变更点上同时估计，并检验效应是否随幅度变化。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：忽略商家的事前反应。</strong> 如果费率变更提前公告（合规要求通常要求提前 15–30 天通知，见<a href=\"../fee-transparency/fee-disclosure-compliance\">费率披露合规</a>），商家会在生效前做出反应：提前囤单、提前调价、提前谈判。这会让&quot;变更前&quot;这段窗口本身就被污染。处理方式是把变更公告日而不是生效日作为分析的时间锚点，并把公告前作为干净的基线期。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：把平台主动调整的其他变量当成不变。</strong> 费率变更时，平台常常同时调整流量分配、推荐权重或活动资源来对冲影响。如果分析中不考虑这些，那么测出的&quot;费率效应&quot;实际上混合了费率与流量干预。<strong>评估设计的纪律是：在评估窗口内冻结其他干预</strong>，或者把它们作为协变量显式控制。做不到时应当声明结论的局限，而不是给一个看似精确的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从评估到决策-效应估计之后做什么\">从评估到决策：效应估计之后做什么</h2><p>得到效应估计后，决策还需要一步：<strong>把效应换算成净收益</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>费率上升的收入</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>lost</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>GMV 流失的收入损失</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>商家流失的长期成本</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\Pi = \\underbrace{\\Delta r \\cdot B_{\\text{post}}}_{\\text{费率上升的收入}} - \\underbrace{r_{\\text{post}} \\cdot \\Delta B_{\\text{lost}}}_{\\text{GMV 流失的收入损失}} - \\underbrace{C_{\\text{churn}}}_{\\text{商家流失的长期成本}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΠ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-ali